---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 25, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — HebrewEdu"
  description="Terms of Service for the HebrewEdu app and website."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="display-lg mt-xs">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>

      <article class="legal-content">

        <section>
          <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By downloading, installing, or using Learn Hebrew – Read & Speak ("the App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the App. These Terms apply to all users of the App, including users of the free and Premium versions.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p>Learn Hebrew – Read & Speak (also referred to as HebrewEdu or AlefBet Tutor) is an educational mobile application developed by VIKTOR SOKOLIUK and distributed through Google Play and the Apple App Store. The App provides structured Hebrew language learning content, including alphabet lessons, vocabulary exercises, reading practice, and audio pronunciation guidance. Some features are available for free; others require a Premium subscription.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Premium Subscription</h2>
          <p>The App may offer Premium access through auto-renewable subscriptions that unlock additional content and features beyond the free tier. Available plans and prices may differ by platform, country, currency, promotions, introductory offers, and store configuration. The applicable purchase screen controls the plans and prices available to you.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Billing:</strong> For iOS, payment is charged through the Apple App Store using your Apple Account. For Android, payment is charged through Google Play using your applicable Google Play account. The applicable store processes the transaction.</li>
            <li><strong>Auto-renewal:</strong> Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each billing period unless cancelled in accordance with the applicable store's rules before the renewal date.</li>
            <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> You manage or cancel a subscription through the store account from which it was purchased—for example, Apple Account subscription settings on iOS or Google Play → Subscriptions on Android. Cancellation generally takes effect at the end of the current billing period, subject to the applicable store's rules.</li>
            <li><strong>Free trials and introductory offers:</strong> An eligible plan may include a free trial or other introductory offer. Eligibility and duration are shown by the applicable store and purchase screen. Unless cancelled in accordance with the applicable store's rules, an eligible trial converts to the displayed paid subscription at the end of the trial.</li>
            <li><strong>Restore Purchases:</strong> The App provides a restore-purchases function for eligible purchases where supported by the applicable store. Restoration is subject to the store's account, transaction, and platform rules.</li>
            <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> Store purchases are processed by Apple or Google Play. Refund requests are handled under the applicable store's policies and procedures. We do not directly process refunds for purchases made through Apple or Google Play.</li>
            <li><strong>Price changes:</strong> Subscription prices and available plans may change. Any applicable notice or consent process is handled according to the applicable store's rules.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Free vs Premium</h2>
          <p>The free version of the App includes access to introductory lessons and a limited selection of content, with daily limits on certain activities and optional rewarded ads. Premium subscribers receive full access to all lessons, reading stories, vocabulary sets, and any future content added to the App, without daily limits and without ads. Features available in each tier are subject to change.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Rewarded Ads and In-App Rewards</h2>
          <p>The free version of the App lets you watch rewarded ads to receive in-app rewards, such as extra daily attempts, extra quiz retries, or in-app coins.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Optional:</strong> Watching ads is always optional.</li>
            <li><strong>Rewards:</strong> A reward is granted only after the ad has been completed. In some cases, such as when an ad cannot be loaded, a reward may still be granted at our discretion.</li>
            <li><strong>Limits and availability:</strong> Daily limits apply to rewarded extras, and ad availability is not guaranteed.</li>
            <li><strong>Virtual items:</strong> Coins and other rewards are virtual, have no monetary value, and cannot be purchased, sold, exchanged, transferred, or redeemed for money or anything else. They may be changed or reset, including daily.</li>
            <li><strong>Premium:</strong> Premium subscribers are not shown ads.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Word Explanations</h2>
          <p>Where available, word explanations are generated automatically using artificial intelligence (OpenAI). They may contain errors and are provided for learning purposes only, without any guarantee of accuracy or completeness.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. User Conduct</h2>
          <p>By using the App, you agree not to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any part of the App</li>
            <li>Copy, reproduce, or distribute App content without prior written permission</li>
            <li>Use the App for any unlawful or unauthorized purpose</li>
            <li>Attempt to circumvent any content restriction or subscription paywall</li>
            <li>Manipulate, automate, or circumvent ad rewards or daily limits</li>
            <li>Interfere with the security or proper functioning of the App</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content within the App — including but not limited to lesson text, audio recordings, illustrations, and interface design — is owned by or licensed to VIKTOR SOKOLIUK. You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the App for personal, non-commercial educational purposes only. No content may be reproduced or distributed without express written permission.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>The App is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the App will be error-free, uninterrupted, or that it will meet your specific learning objectives. Language learning outcomes depend on individual effort and practice.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, VIKTOR SOKOLIUK shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of or inability to use the App, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Termination</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the App at our discretion, without notice, if we believe you have violated these Terms. Upon termination, your right to use the App ceases immediately. Provisions that by their nature should survive termination will remain in effect.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Apple App Store</h2>
          <p>If you downloaded the App from the Apple App Store, Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Licensed Application End User License Agreement (Standard EULA)</a> applies in addition to these Terms. Apple is not responsible for the App or its content and has no obligation to provide maintenance or support for it. Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these Terms and may enforce them against you.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. When we make significant changes, we will notify users via an in-app notice or by updating this page. Continued use of the App after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>14. Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Developer:</strong> VIKTOR SOKOLIUK</li>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:vicsothemes@gmail.com">vicsothemes@gmail.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-page { background: #f8f8f6; }

.legal-container {
  max-width: var(--w-narrow);
  padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl);
}

.legal-header {
  padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
}

.legal-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.75rem; }

.legal-content section h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.legal-content p, .legal-content li {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--ink-light);
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.legal-content ul {
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.375rem;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.legal-content a { color: var(--brand); text-decoration: underline; }

/* Сброс глобального section { padding-block } */
.legal-content section { padding-block: 0; }
</style>
